Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["a)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980751138579958*^9, 
  3.9807511389380264`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"54e1229e-1d66-764c-8d89-\
fd89194d5f16"],

Cell["\<\
Stadierne er hver iteration.
Rekursionen er at hvis man p\[ARing] optimal vis er kommer til en given \
destination (stage), s\[ARing] m\[ARing] man v\[AE]re kommet til alle andre \
stages p\[ARing] optimal vis, eller det er det ma sikrer.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9807511444543686`*^9, 3.9807512173697586`*^9}, {
  3.980751254711399*^9, 
  3.980751259564192*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7dbebdd9-a0e7-a74f-b450-\
962fbfa43b68"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["b)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980747186942999*^9, 3.9807471878052387`*^9}, {
  3.9807511357779922`*^9, 
  3.980751135903517*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f421ef1b-ff3a-2345-a7c3-\
0f6812e5eb12"],

Cell["\<\
Problemet kan ikke l\[OSlash]ses med Dijkstras algoritme, eftersom der er \
negative edgeweights nogle stedet. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9807472031095448`*^9, 
  3.9807472301376896`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5b68b4f1-51df-0245-b62a-\
fad29a278235"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["b)", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9807472333525314`*^9, 
  3.980747233701069*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"bc161469-bedf-e942-8c62-\
e292d9df9736"],

Cell["\<\
Man kan godt l\[OSlash]se problemet med bellman-Fords algoritme, da der ingen \
negative cykles er. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.980747235886877*^9, 3.980747251129553*^9}, {
  3.9807511224782486`*^9, 
  3.9807511282001495`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"d3a1199e-8779-ee42-97c6-\
737d40cfb95f"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

