  FormBox["600", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "9e067dbb-503a-2e46-afe8-57447493a4a3"],
 " kroner. Dermed bliver vores objektivfunktion (i timer)"
