   RowBox[{"(", 
    RowBox[{"i", ",", "j"}], ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "11e7973e-426c-f848-bb3b-82edcf521aa2"],
 " alle muligheder man har, for at sende gaver fra et sted til et andet. "
